  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Slice carrot into half-moons.\n• Place carrot and peeled & chopped pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Season with salt, drizzle with olive oil and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/640546c896f1a8092009c5f6/step-9fb2dc53.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop tomato. Finely chop garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/640546c896f1a8092009c5f6/step-b8fd6e60.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook 1/2 the garlic, until fragrant, 1 minute. Transfer to a small bowl.\n• Add Greek-style yoghurt and stir to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/640546c896f1a8092009c5f6/step-0391b170.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return saucepan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook tomato, stirring, until starting to soften, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add ginger paste, mild curry paste and remaining garlic and cook, stirring, until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/640546c896f1a8092009c5f6/step-f4fe82ce.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To pan, stir in coconut milk, vegetable stock pot, red lentils, the water and the brown sugar. Bring to the boil, then reduce heat to medium.\n• Cover with a lid and cook, stirring occasionally, until lentils are softened, 20-22 minutes.\n• Stir in roast veggies and baby spinach leaves, until wilted and combined. Season to taste. TIP: Add a splash of water to loosen the dhal, if needed.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/640546c896f1a8092009c5f6/step-2851592a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide roast veggie curry lentil dhal between bowls.\n• Top with garlic yoghurt.\n• Sprinkle over flaked almonds. Tear over coriander to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/640546c896f1a8092009c5f6/step-b17e927a.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
